# FEEL-4: East has a double tap (F) and a triple tap (G). Quick taps (10 ms down, 30 ms apart) and
# relaxed ones (150 ms down, 100 ms apart) both count as a double tap; a gap longer than the 250 ms
# window makes two single taps instead (E, E) with nothing else fired.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Gestures
tap east 10
advance 20
tap east 10
advance 400
tap east 150
advance 100
tap east 150
advance 400
tap east 30
advance 400
tap east 30
advance 400
---
key KEY_F down @290
key KEY_F up   @290
key KEY_F down @1090
key KEY_F up   @1090
key KEY_E down @1520
key KEY_E up   @1520
key KEY_E down @1950
key KEY_E up   @1950
